# ---------------- Gib.events (Task 16 Part E) ----------------
# One chunk burst for a death: the dying sheet spawns three of these at slightly different
# offsets (`spawn Gib at me offset 0 / 12 / -12`), which reads as a scattered spray without
# needing a random offset in the event language.
#
# Gated on `my spawnedFrom` for the same reason as the other effects: the template's sheet runs
# at scene start even while the actor is inactive, and an ungated `destroy me` would eat it.
#
# Particle side (the `gib` asset on the ParticleEffect child): a handful of small chunks, random
# initial velocity 200-400 cm/s, gravity on, ~3 s life. `ExplosionDeath` enemies spawn an
# Explosion instead — see the ship sheet in `Enemy.events`.

when me appears
  my spawnedFrom is "Gib"
  play particle "gib"
  wait 3 seconds
  destroy me
